- [Why are you looking at me like that?|I'm not fragile.|Save the pep talk.]
- [Okay, that's a bit much.|You're making it weird.|Just... don't.]
- [I didn't ask for help.|I can handle it myself.|Leave it.]
- [I don't need saving from {who}.|What makes you think I can't handle {who}?]
- [Did I look that pathetic just now?|Do I look like I'm about to cry?] [I'm just talking.|Stop.]

@rule react.comfort.bad.onday
on react
when move=comfort fit=bad kind=day
