- [I-I felt the same.|You mean that?|Don't say it so casually.]
- [Hehe... that makes me happy.|I'm glad you liked it too.|Then let's make more memories.]
- [Me too. A lot.|I think about it too.|...Yeah. It was special.]

# ================= tease =================

@rule react.share.us.onday
on react
when move=share kind=us fit=good|neutral
feel shy
- [So you remember {mything} like that too.|You still think about {mything}?] [I'm so glad.|My heart...]
- [I thought I was the only one who cared about {mything}.|I was scared {mything} was nothing to you.] [Thank you.|Don't say that so lightly.]
- [{Mything} was only {when}, and I already miss it.|{When} feels so far away.] [Is that silly?|Hehe.]
- [If you keep saying things like that about {mything}, I'll get used to it.|Keep talking about {mything} like that, and I'll start hoping.] [Careful.|I mean it.]
- [I'm writing this down. {Mything}, best thing this month.|That's going in my diary.] [Don't you dare laugh.|Hehe.]

@rule react.tease.good
