- [Watch it, or I'll get you back.|Ha! You're asking for it.|Rude! ...Funny, but rude.]
- [{laugh} Okay, you got me.|Fine, fine, I deserve that.|Hmph! I'll remember this.]
- [You're lucky you're cute.|I'll let it slide. Once.|Oh, you think you're so funny.]
- [Hey, nobody makes fun of {like} and walks away!|You dare tease me about {like}?] [{laugh}|Say that again!]
- [I'm telling {who} you said that.|Wait until {who} hears this.] [{laugh}|You're dead.]

@rule react.tease.good.onday
on react
when move=tease fit=good kind=day
feel laugh
