- [I tell you about {mything} and that's what I get?|That's what you do with {mything}?] [You're terrible.|{laugh}]
- [Okay, that was a good one about {mything}.|I walked right into that one with {mything}.] [{laugh}|Don't get used to it.]

@rule react.tease.good.go
on react
when move=tease fit=good step<=2
opens tease,praise,invite
feel laugh
