- [Ha! Bold of you.|Careful now.] [My turn next.|I'll get you back, you know.]
- [{laugh} Okay, okay.|You're in a mood today.] [What's gotten into you?|Keep going, I dare you.]
- [Wow, picking on me now?|Is that how it is?] [Then I won't go easy either.|You're on.]
- [Keep it up, and I'll tell everyone what I know about you.|I've got stories about you too.] [{laugh}|Try me.]
- [You're as bad as {who}!|Did {who} teach you that?] [{laugh}|Unbelievable.]
- [Mock {like} one more time, I dare you.|If you say one more thing about {like}...] [{laugh}|You'll see.]

@rule react.tease.good.go.onday
on react
when move=tease fit=good step<=2 kind=day
opens tease,praise,invite
feel laugh
- [Oh, we're making jokes about {mything} now?|You think {mything} is funny?] [Fine. What about your grades?|Let's talk about you, then.]
- [You're enjoying this way too much.|Why are you grinning like that about {mything}?] [Stop it!|My turn.]

@rule react.tease.neutral
on react
when move=tease fit=neutral
