- [Hmph. Whatever.|You're weird.|Real mature.]
- [I'll laugh later.|Close, but no.|Nice try.]
- [{Who} makes that joke every day.|You and {who} have the same sense of humor.] [Sadly.|Not a compliment.]
- [You're not the first to joke about me and {like}.|Everyone has a joke about {like}.] [Try again.|Mm-hm.]

@rule react.tease.neutral.onday
on react
when move=tease fit=neutral kind=day
