- [Keep that up and I'm leaving.|You're on thin ice.|Stop it.]
- [Leave {who} out of your jokes.|That's not funny when it's about {who}.]
- [Don't make fun of {like}.|You can joke about me, not {like}.] [I mean it.|Stop.]

@rule react.tease.bad.onday
