- {student}[Sure. Pick me up after class?|Deal.] [You're paying, though.|Don't be late.]
- [Is that an invitation? ...Okay.|Fine, you convinced me.] [It better be fun.|I'll make time.]
- [Should I bring something?|Wait, is it just us?] [Tell me!|I need to know what to wear.]
- [We could {favdo} first.|Can we {favdo}? I've got this idea.] [Then food.|You'll like it.]
- [Not a word to {who}, okay?|If {who} finds out, I'll never hear the end of it.] [Hehe.|Shh.]

@rule react.invite.good.go.onday
