# ================= correct / deny / admit / hush =================

@rule react.invite.bad.mood.onday
on react
when move=invite fit=bad mood=upset kind=day
feel pout
- [I'm upset about {mything} and you want to go out?|Did you hear what I said about {mything}?]
- [Don't pretend {mything} can be fixed with a walk.|A trip won't fix {mything}.]

@rule react.correct.good
on react
when move=correct fit=good
feel surprised
- [Oh! That's not what I heard at all.|Wait, really? Then {src} got it wrong.|Huh. I'm glad you told me.] [I'll set people straight.|Sorry I believed it.]
- [Seriously? Wow, people exaggerate.|That makes way more sense.] [I'll tell the others.|Good to know.]
- [I knew something was off.|Huh, so that's what happened.] [Thanks for clearing it up.|I feel dumb now.]
- [Then the rumor is wrong?|Oh, that's a relief.] [I won't repeat it.|I'll correct anyone who says it.]
- [I'll tell {src} it's not like that.|Wait until I tell {src}.] [Don't worry.|Leave it to me.]
- [I'm glad I heard it from you and not the hallway.|Better to hear it from you.] [Thanks.|Really.]

@rule react.correct.good.onday
on react
when move=correct fit=good kind=day
feel surprised
- [So what they said about {mything} isn't true?|Then I had {mything} all wrong.] [Thanks for telling me.|I'm sorry.]
- [Now that you've explained {mything}, it makes sense.|{Mything} sounded strange to me from the start.] [I'm glad.|That's better.]
- [People love twisting things like {mything}.|Who started that version of {mything}?] [I should've asked you first.|Sorry.]

@rule react.correct.neutral
on react
when move=correct fit=neutral
- [Maybe. Hard to say.|Well, you would say that.|Hm. I'll think about it.]
- [It's your word against theirs.|I don't know who to believe.|Okay... maybe.]
- [People say a lot of things.|I'll keep an open mind.|Could be.]
- [If you say so.|Hm. We'll see.|I'm not sure.]
- [That's not how {src} told it.|{Src} tells it differently.] [I don't know who to believe.|Hm.]
- [So you say.|It's possible.] [I wasn't there, so...|What can I say?]

@rule react.correct.neutral.onday
on react
when move=correct fit=neutral kind=day
- [Maybe that's what happened with {mything}.|I can't check {mything} either way.] [I'll keep it in mind.|Hm.]
- [There are a lot of versions of {mything} going around.|Yours is the third version of {mything} I've heard.]
- [I want to believe you about {mything}.|You sound sure about {mything}.] [But still.|Let me think.]

@rule react.correct.bad
on react
when move=correct fit=bad
- [That's not what everyone says.|I know what I saw.|Sure. Of course.]
- [Nice try.|You'd say that either way.|Right, and I'm the dean.]
- [Everyone's wrong except you, huh?|That's convenient.|Uh-huh.]
- [I'm not stupid.|Save it.|I don't believe you.]
- [{Src} told me everything, and that's not it.|Are you calling {src} a liar?]
- [If it's not true, why do you look so nervous?|Then why is everyone saying it?] [Well?|Hm?]

@rule react.correct.bad.onday
on react
when move=correct fit=bad kind=day
- [I know what I know about {mything}.|You won't talk your way out of {mything}.]
- [Sure, {mything} just happened to look like that.|Of course {mything} was a misunderstanding.] [Uh-huh.|Right.]
- [Don't make excuses about {mything}.|You always have an explanation.] [Enough.|I'm tired of it.]

@rule react.deny.good
on react
when move=deny fit=good
- [Okay... I believe you.|Then people are making things up.|I knew it sounded weird.]
- [Yeah, that didn't sound like you.|Phew. Okay.|Good. I didn't want it to be true.]
- [Then I'll stop listening to rumors.|I trust you.|People are so dumb sometimes.]
- [Alright. I'll take your word for it.|That's a relief.|Okay, forget I asked.]
- [I'll tell {src} to stop spreading it.|{Src} should check things first.] [Sorry.|Don't worry.]
- [Sorry for bringing it up.|I shouldn't have asked.] [I'm glad it's nothing.|Forget it.]
- [I knew there was something off about that story.|That story never made sense.] [Good.|Right?]

@rule react.deny.good.onday
on react
when move=deny fit=good kind=day
- [I didn't think you'd do something like {mything}.|{Mything} didn't sound like you.] [I'm relieved.|Good.]
- [Then I won't believe any more of that about {mything}.|If you say {mything} isn't true, it isn't.] [Okay.|Good enough.]

@rule react.deny.neutral
on react
when move=deny fit=neutral
- [Hm. If you say so.|Okay... I guess.|Maybe.]
- [I'll pretend I believe you.|Sure.|Alright.]
- [I'm not convinced, but okay.|Whatever you say.|Hm.]
- [We'll see.|That's what they all say.|Okay, okay.]
- [{Src} seemed awfully certain.|That's not what {src} said.] [But okay.|Hm.]
- [I won't call you a liar.|I'm not accusing you.] [I'm just saying.|Yet.]

@rule react.deny.neutral.onday
on react
when move=deny fit=neutral kind=day
- [You don't sound very sure about {mything}.|If you say {mything} isn't true...] [Okay.|Fine.]
- [Everyone denies things like {mything}.|That's what anyone would say about {mything}.]
- [I'll stop asking about {mything}.|Let's leave {mything} there.] [For now.|Mm.]

@rule react.deny.bad
