- [You're a terrible liar.|Wow. Okay. Lie to my face.|Do you think I'm blind?]
- [That's worse than just admitting it.|Unbelievable.|Don't insult me.]
- [I know what I saw.|Stop it.|You're digging yourself deeper.]
- [It was {when}. I remember exactly.|{When}. Don't tell me it wasn't you.]
- [Keep lying and see what I tell people.|Say that again and I'll stop being quiet about it.] [I'm serious.|Try me.]

@rule react.deny.bad.onday
on react
when move=deny fit=bad kind=day
feel pout
- [I saw {mything} with my own eyes.|How can you deny {mything} to me?] [Stop it.|Unbelievable.]
- [Do you think I invented {mything}?|So I just imagined {mything}?] [Really?|Wow.]
- [I gave you a chance to be honest about {mything}.|I'd have respected the truth about {mything}.]

@rule react.admit.good
on react
when move=admit fit=good
