- [You should've thought about {mything} before.|You did {mything}, and I'm supposed to stay quiet?]
- [I'm not lying to my friends about {mything}.|If someone asks me about {mything}, I'll tell them.]

@rule react.agree
on react
when move=agree fit=good|neutral
