- [See? That's what's strange about {mything}.|That's what I told everyone about {mything}.] [Nobody listened.|Right?]
- [If even you think so, {mything} must be real.|You don't usually agree with me.] [Huh.|This is new.]

@rule react.agree.bad
on react
when move=agree fit=bad
feel worried
