- [I'm just telling you what I heard.|I didn't say I believed it.|Hm.]
- [Could be. People talk.|Sure. Maybe.|Okay, okay.]
- [Whatever you say.|I'm not taking sides.|Hm, maybe.]
- [I'm not attacking {who}.|I've got nothing against {who}.] [I'm only saying.|Relax.]
- [You know {who} better than I do, then?|Have you talked to {who} about it?] [Just asking.|Hm.]
- [Maybe {who} has a reason.|I guess only {who} knows.] [I wouldn't know.|Who can say?]
- [Fair enough, I won't push it.|You could be right.] [Let's leave it.|Okay.]

